Crystallized Ginger, is also known as bulk candied ginger, candied ginger, bulk crystallized ginger, or whole candied ginger.
Crystallized Ginger is made from real ginger root, Zingiber officianale, sliced and left to macerate in cane sugar. Maceration allows the woody fibers in the ginger to soften and the liquids locked in the fibers to release, creating a chewy, vibrant ginger that’s both sweet and spicy.
