Dendritic Salt is a very fine, high-purity salt. It is also referred to as star salt or dendritic chloride.
Dendritic Salt is refined to produce salt crystals that are porous and star shaped. These qualities allow the salt to absorb flavors and odors, and easily disperse throughout a product, creating even, rich flavor through a dish or seasoning blend.
