Diablo Burger Seasoning is great for making burgers, steaks, meatballs, barbecue rubs, jams and jellies, sauces, chili, relishes and chutneys, hot chicken or cauliflower wings, and potato wedges. Pair with ground meats, grilled meats and vegetables, stewed fruits, breadings, cheeses, and vegetables like sweet potato or corn.

Dried Scallions, Allium fistulosum, are the green, flaky granules produced from a bulb-less, herbaceous variety member of the onion family. They are also called minced green onion, freeze dried spring onion, dehydrated green onions, chopped dried scallions, bunching onions, or spring onions.
Though they are often called “spring onions” that is a bit of a misnomer, since any onion picked early in the year are also referred to as spring onions. The term “scallion” specifically refers to the long, cylindrical onion that does not develop a bulb.
Dried Scallions are popular with:
meal kit, frozen food, soup mix, snack, and sauce manufacturers;
