Spicy Pumpkin Pie Spice can also be used to create savory and sweet pasta sauce, hummus, stuffings, and fruit compotes and sauces. Pair it with winter squash dishes, lentils and beans, butter, roasted vegetables, turkey, or chicken. It’s delicious in coffees, teas, chocolate beverages and foods, baked goods, or even steeped with alcohol.

Star Anise, Illicium verum, is a woodsy, pungent spice. It is also known as Chinese anise, star anise petal, wholesale star anise and star anise bulk.
Despite being considered a spice, Star Anise is a fruit. It comes from the Chinese evergreen tree, indigenous to China and Vietnam.
